1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,200
Canada C11 ya America E-2?

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,000
Zyada log pehla sawal hi galat poochte hain.

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,900
Sab poochte hain, kaunsa sasta hai?

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,900
But cost is not the first question.

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,000
The first question is your passport.

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,900
Kya aapki nationality allowed hai?

7
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:19,000
E-2 sirf treaty countries ke liye hai.

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,300
Good news: Pakistan 1961 se is list par hai.

9
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:25,900
Koi fixed amount nahi, lekin investment substantial honi chahiye.

10
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:30,000
Aur agar aap Dubai ya Saudi Arabia mein kaam kar rahe hain,

11
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,900
aapka Pakistani passport phir bhi qualify karta hai.

12
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:37,000
Canada C11 mein koi country list nahi.

13
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,500
Lekin business aapka hona chahiye, aur aap control karein.

14
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:43,900
Aur yaad rakhein: C11 ka time Express Entry CEC mein count nahi hota.

15
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:47,200
Dono temporary hain. Dono alag darwaze hain.

16
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:51,900
Sahi darwaza aapke passport aur aapke long-term plan par depend karta hai.

17
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:55,400
Passport first, then the plan.

18
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:59,900
Comment ‘BUSINESS’ and Vanguard ki team aapka route map karegi.

